# provider_compaction.pdf is deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# main.pdf and main_neurips.pdf ARE tracked, and paper-build CI fails if they
# drift from source (see #128). That guard only works because CI can rebuild
# them byte-identically with latexmk.
#
# This paper has no committed PDF, so there is nothing that can go stale: CI
# still compiles the .tex on every PR to catch a LaTeX error or a missing
# generated/ macro fragment. Tracking a PDF that no check verifies would be
# strictly worse than not tracking one at all.
#
# Read it locally with:
#   cd docs/paper && tectonic -X compile provider_compaction.tex --outdir .
# arXiv compiles the .tex itself, so no PDF is needed to submit.
provider_compaction.pdf
